macos-26-titlebar

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Fit the macOS 26 titlebar: hide the background macOS 26 and later draw over the transparent titlebar, as Ghostty does, and leave room for the wider-spaced window buttons at any zoom.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: GPUI or Herdr hides the macOS 26 titlebar background and sizes the window-button gap for macOS 26 itself.
